    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.24.2#p1-a3db79c5",
     "text": "While their father yet lived.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "before their father"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.24.7",
   "range": "1CH.24.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c96de228",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.24.7#p1-c96de228",
     "text": "This lot was ordained to take away all occasion of envy or grudging of one against another.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "lot came forth to Jehoiarib"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.24.10",
   "range": "1CH.24.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7db36177",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.24.10#p1-7db36177",
     "text": "Zachariah the father of John the Baptist was of this course or lot of Abia, Lu 1:5.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "Abijah",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Lu 1:5",
       "ref": "LUK.1.5"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.24.19",
   "range": "1CH.24.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7aee1d36",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.24.19#p1-7aee1d36",
     "text": "By the dignity that God gave to Aaron.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "Aaron their father"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.24.30",
   "range": "1CH.24.30",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ca17b579",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.24.30#p1-ca17b579",
     "text": "Who was the second son of Merari.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "Mushi"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.24.31",
   "range": "1CH.24.31",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7532f7b8",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.24.31#p1-7532f7b8",
     "text": "That is, every one had that honour which fell to him by lot.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "lots over against their brethren the"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
